---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Road Freight"
  description="European road freight and specialised haulage with reliable partners across the network."
  image="/images/road.jpg"
>
  <Hero
    compact
    brand="ROAD"
    headline="Ground transport that reaches remote places."
    support="Daily European services and dedicated options for specialised consignments."
    image="/images/road.jpg"
    secondaryCta={{ label: 'Get a Quote', href: '/quote' }}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content reveal">
      <p>
        Nexar Solutions works with large multinational haulage companies that operate daily services
        across Europe and beyond, as well as smaller specialists for dedicated services. This lets us
        provide the right service for your consignment.
      </p>
      <p>
        We stay focused on reliable, custom-designed support — using ground transportation to reach even
        the most remote places when needed.
      </p>

      <h2>Germany ↔ UK road freight</h2>
      <p>
        Post-Brexit, shipping between the UK and Germany requires careful documentation. An Economic
        Operators Registration and Identification (EORI) number is needed for both the UK and Germany,
        alongside other customs documents.
      </p>
      <p>
        Through an extended depot network, vans can pick up shipments quickly and get goods on their
        way. Our road freight services emphasise safety — combining best industry practices with
        experienced drivers on both sides.
      </p>
      <p>
        Options accommodate unique requests: UK and EU pallets, oddly shaped products, light or heavy
        loads — all at competitive prices.
      </p>

      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote">Request a road freight quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
  }

  .btn {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
